        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 26 at 3:23PM ChST by NWS Tiyan GU</headline>
        <description>At 323 PM ChST, trained weather spotters reported gusty showers
capable of producing a landspout over Pago Bay, moving southeast at
5 mph.

HAZARD...Landspouts and wind gusts up to 40 mph.

SOURCE...Trained weather spotters.

IMPACT...Minor damage to outdoor objects is possible. Gusty winds

could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured

objects.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
